# dP Relay dashboard environment (Vite: only VITE_* vars reach the client)
# Base URL of the dP Relay v5 API. The build script defaults it to the
# production URL, so a no-env build deploys as-is; override for staging.
#
# STAGE F12: must be the API SUBDOMAIN, not the onrender.com origin.
# `app.dprelay.digital-papyrus.com` (dashboard) and
# `api.dprelay.digital-papyrus.com` (API) share a registrable domain, so the
# SameSite=Lax session cookie is same-site and login works. The onrender.com
# origin is a different SITE (and a PSL entry) — cookies never travel to it.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.dprelay.digital-papyrus.com
